# COURSE_ID knowledge-point mistake bank (mistake_bank)

> One entry corresponds to one stable knowledge-point key, not to a fixed problem. A different surface
> problem serves only as evidence of the error or as a retest variant.
> Understanding in the moment does not count as a formal correct answer; formal results use `✓/△/✗`, and the
> state rules are governed by `50_playbook/mistake_retest.md`.

