## Entry format

```markdown
### M-0001
- Knowledge point key: course / chapter / knowledge point
- First date: YYYY-MM-DD
- Source: lessonNN / textbook page
- Error evidence: one sentence
- Root-cause tag: tag
- Root cause: the concept-layer reason
- Correct understanding: one sentence
- Understood in the moment: unconfirmed / restated after explanation / corrected independently
- Current cycle: 1
- Status: active / maintenance / aged
- Current cycle summary: attempts 0/6 | independent correct 0/3 | failures 0 | consecutive correct after an error 0/2
- Last formal retest: —
- Next retest allowed: YYYY-MM-DD
- Aged consecutive correct: 0/2
- Latest aged review set: —
- Next aged calendar check: —

| Cycle | Date | Sessions elapsed | Probe/variant | Result | Hint | Basis of judgement |
|---:|---|---:|---|---|---|---|
```

